 people and disrupted operations, the rebels said, as Yemen's conflict continues to escalate beyond its borders.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Why music in Iran is more than just entertainment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5e26882e5e3c2a6f56c2d65a8edfa7632a8504584041958db4b3ec7fbf731ba1</id><updated>2026-10-08T06:19:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T05:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-music-in-iran-is-more-than-just-entertainment/a-79583224--67cbee1305a2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-music-in-iran-is-more-than-just-entertainment/a-79583224?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Iranian authorities are trying to persuade prominent singers in exile to return home. While the state seeks to harness music as a political tool, music has also become a powerful expression of dissent and resistance.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Opposition doubles down against poll chief after detentions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:96c6ad6b7aa14102568e52f2ea88f1e4c46a204c32e7beb8568b70975fec5a9d</id><updated>2026-10-08T06:20:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T04:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-opposition-doubles-down-against-poll-chief-after-detentions/live-79587554--49a24ea9d897.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-opposition-doubles-down-against-poll-chief-after-detentions/live-79587554?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">India's opposition alliance is gearing up for another day of protests after demonstrating lawmakers were detained for the second time. Meanwhile, India is seeking to repatriate its nationals working in Russian military.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Sudan's road to elections remains uncertain</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e239bcfef86ba68eb571181ce3d8b6b5ffa9add5