pakistan/a-79587047?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pakistan's dependence on Gulf energy imports, remittances and regional financing has left the economy exposed to the fallout from the Middle East conflict.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil: Thousands of students march against Bolsonaro</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:65a4e6aa175e6514842e39bae0b64e97338f8ef53cfe35e6861b89b766d59720</id><updated>2026-10-08T06:20:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T00:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-thousands-of-students-march-against-bolsonaro/a-79586626--65ddc4523aa9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-thousands-of-students-march-against-bolsonaro/a-79586626?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After Flavio Bolsonaro came out on top in the first round of Brazil's presidential election, thousands of people joined student-led protests against the far-right in Rio de Janeiro.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Christa Pike 'angry and confused' after botched execution</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7fe92151ddc13e5906a00615ad338b7cdb365e8b8a6e3278a1f75f3b11a1ac4a</id><updated>2026-10-08T06:20:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T21:23:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/christa-pike-angry-and-confused-after-botched-execution/a-79586250--50a03a637dd2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/christa-pike-angry-and-confused-after-botched-execution/a-79586250?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pike's lawyers have said she was very aware of Tennessee's failed execution effort. A judge has ordered state officials to preserve all evidence from the botched execution.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>As US midterm elections loom, Trump's campaign tactics are becoming increasingly unusual, and expensive</title><id>urn:rs