1fb16d29f71</id><updated>2026-10-08T06:19:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T17:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-pakistan-turkey-could-the-mecca-defense-pact-become-a-game-changer-in-the-war-against-t/a-79577245--88d642176557.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-pakistan-turkey-could-the-mecca-defense-pact-become-a-game-changer-in-the-war-against-the-houthis-in-yemen/a-79577245?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pakistan and Turkey have agreed to provide "practical measures" to defend Saudi Arabia against Houthi attacks. Could a new alliance reshape the war against the Houthis in Yemen?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Russia: WHO not able to 'fully' assess plague situation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:152c3f969321dbc52c028324cffe66c131369cfb2d1a7c6413d4a9eef153b3cd</id><updated>2026-10-08T06:19:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T17:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-who-not-able-to-fully-assess-plague-situation/a-79584532--9575424040bd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-who-not-able-to-fully-assess-plague-situation/a-79584532?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The UN health agency said Russia should be more transparent about the case of the plague as reports of a second case of the disease emerged. Russia played down any concerns, saying the population faces no risk.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Gerhard Schröder visits latest Russian employer, Hyperglobus</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a185cb545ae4324115df7abcd455972ca184e9f7e286002f730575adeb0fa5ae</id><updated>2026-10-08T06:19:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T16:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/gerhard-schr_der-visits-latest-russian-employer-hyperglobus/a-79583018--1d88da466f5d.html" type="text/htm